# R61: RAM payload, offline review only

Accepted R61 objects are relinked with all required exact fallbacks. No math objects or SDK project were rebuilt. Only bench.c and embedded blobs.S were recompiled; 79 reviewed worker objects (including the R2 RTC-safe USB clock startup) were reused. Legacy R55 file/section/CDC names are transport identifiers, not the math source revision.

The payload fits the reviewed layout: worker 0x20001000..0x2000a000; Qfplib 0x2000a000..0x2000c000; math data 16B at 0x2000c000; math main 208312B from 0x2000c010 (568B free); hot 3988B from 0x2003f000 (108B free); core0 stack 0x20040000..0x20041000. First 4KiB and core1 bank remain untouched. Entry 0x20001001, VTOR 0x20001100, initial SP 0x20041000. Binary 257940B is RAM-only. Flash-writer and UID-reader functions are absent.

The finite matrix contains all 94 R59, 9 R60 and 66 R61 repaired argument pairs; both recent boundary sets, 11 R61 declines (+7/+8/+9 old Flash instructions), 8 unchanged inverse-root and 6 normal controls, and all 24 prior physical pairs. 724 unique pairs, 2172 states, READY/DIRTY/PENDING each. 8688 newly completed RAM math calls, all candidate outputs correct against previously pinned independent gold; zero fresh MPFR calls. All 169 repaired pairs remain no slower than correct Qfplib entries. 76 targeted pairs still lose: retained openly in ram-validation.json. These are not new global speed claims. Actual hardware cycles are not measured.

Actual CRT: 2779 instructions to runtime_init, 921 writes, reserved ranges untouched. Worker primitives: 148 qualified calls and 147 checks; a previous 148-call HOST run failed only on an ELF symbol-type audit for _entry_point (STT_NOTYPE), preserved separately. Total completed function calls including that diagnostic and one actual loader call: 8985. CRC/parser/reset/driver-corruption controls pass. 183 linked worker functions and the complete entry prefix are byte-exact to reviewed R2; main differs only in six pinned metadata literals. Prior full peripheral startup qualification is inherited, not rerun or counted as fresh.

A first physical smoke is exactly 24 pairs/72 states, 78 queries, 2940 target calls including calibration, at most 300s. All subsequent batches are finite proposals, not automatic authority. Use a reviewed live supervisor with a fresh exact Root grant and fresh device/state/Flash evidence. No direct driver execution, USB enumeration, device I/O, Flash writes, RTC setters, APP/SD/key operations, or Git changes were performed here. Universal CR, totality, stack and FMA/full-library/integration acceptance remain open.
